# The single-player golden's script (tools/replay/golden-sp). Hand-written
# scrasm (formats/scr.zig), no game data. Runs on the synthetic test map:
# open fields below block 32, the city grid from 32 to 224.
#
# Positions are script fixed point (14 fraction bits): block b's centre is
# b * 16384 + 8192; 4177920 (255.0) is "on the ground".
#
# What it exercises: declarations (player, phone, parked car, an area
# trigger, a display slot), a second thread, a ringing phone, the player
# walking into the trigger area next to it, a mission sub-script (timer, a mission car, an armed character, wanted
# stars, score), the main thread waiting on a counter, then clearing the
# wanted level and killing the mission's character.

.string 30 mission golden_m1.mis

.main
1 counter 0             # heartbeat, counted by the second thread
2 counter 0             # missions passed
3 counter 0             # main thread's stage
5 player_ped 0 0 L:335872 L:335872 L:4177920 90 0          # player at (20, 20)
6 16 0 0 L:434176 L:335872 L:4177920 178 0                 # phone (model 178) at (26, 20)
7 10 0 0 L:368640 L:401408 L:4177920 90 0 0 0xFFFF         # parked car at (22, 24)
8 214 0 0 0 40 L:434176 L:335872 L:16384 L:32768 L:32768 5   # on foot in a 2x2 area at (26, 20): start 40
9 display_decl
20 level_start
21 start_thread 31 30
22 168 6 0 0            # ring the phone for anyone, no timeout
23 set 3 1
24 eq 2 1               # mission passed?
25 if 0 27
26 set 3 2 -> 28
27 wait 30 -> 24
28 wait 900
29 163 5 -> 33          # clear the wanted level
30 thread_decl
31 inc 1
32 wait 60 -> 31
33 371 60               # kill the mission's character
34 set 3 3 -> end
40 label
41 mission 30 -> end

.mission golden_m1 100 101
100 counter 0
101 mission_begin
102 timer 9 20          # 600 ticks on the clock
103 44 50 0 L:499712 L:434176 L:4177920 90 0 0 0xFFFF      # mission car at (30, 26) into 50
104 42 60 0 L:499712 L:499712 L:4177920 0 0 18             # character at (30, 30) into 60
105 138 60 6            # armed with a shotgun
106 wait 600
107 164 5 3             # three wanted stars
108 inc 2
109 392 5 0 L:1000      # score
110 timer_clear 9
111 mission_end
